episode.

00:08:22.560 --> 00:08:26.360
You can leave me suggestions for what to do
them on in the comments.

00:08:26.360 --> 00:08:32.560
Right now learn all about Ser Duncan the tall
here and you can click here for my review

00:08:32.560 --> 00:08:33.560
of episode 1.

00:08:33.560 --> 00:08:35.430
Thanks for watching, see you tomorrow.

